<Defs>
  <!--
    Explicit WNG item crafting recipes.
    These replace ThingDef.recipeMaker-generated recipes so WNG does not participate in
    RimWorld's global generated make-recipe pass. Recipe users are declared explicitly:
    historically intended vanilla workbenches are restored without clearing or replacing
    vanilla or third-party bill lists, while specialist alien fabrication remains WNG-owned.
  -->
